title WF05 Credit top-up via PayOS (b) - webhook and credit
|PayOS|
start
:Send webhook to LumiGap;
|LumiGap platform|
if (Signature ok (if key set),\ncode 00 and amount matches?) then ([no])
  :Reject or ignore webhook,\norder stays pending;
  stop
else ([yes])
endif
:Add credits once and\nmark order paid;
|User|
:See updated balance and\norder history;
stop
